WEBVTT

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:13.360
This is great! Nice weather
and beautiful scenery!

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.490
This must be the charm of traveling!
Yes! That's for sure!

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.000
Hosei's not acting right...

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.830
What's wrong, Taity?
Why the puzzled face?

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.000
T-Taity?!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.010
Just look at that clear, blue sky, Taity!

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.880
And if you listen closely...

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.110
There! Do you hear
the singing of the birds?

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:37.750
Y-yeah...

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:41.750
All right, everyone!
It's one last stretch to the capital!

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.690
Let's lift our spirits up and go!

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:48.950
Hosei is <i>definitely</i> not acting right...

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:59.400
Hey, Laila. What's wrong with ol' Hosei?

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:03.100
He's smiling like crazy,
despite what happened...

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.820
Sheesh! You're so dense, Taito!

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:14.450
It's obvious Hosei is
forcing himself to smile.

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.120
Forcing himself?

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:20.460
I'm sure Hosei is making a desperate
effort in his own unique way

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:22.290
to hide his sadness...

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:25.760
Oh... He's...

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:30.170
Hey! What're you guys doing?
Pick up the pace!

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:39.810
The bridge is rotting.

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:42.250
I don't think we'll be able to cross this.

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:47.520
Don't be silly, Taity!
We can cross this A-OK!

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.190
Crossing the bridge! Crossing--

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:51.620
--Wait! Hosei!
--That's dangerous!

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:53.590
Hosei!

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:22.650
He really has it bad...

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:23.660
Yeah...

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.460
But he did strike down his master
who was like a mother to him.

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:30.390
It is only natural for him
to be this way, but...

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:36.640
What's the big deal?! Then let's
just figure out a way to help him!

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:41.470
Taito. You make it sound easy,
but what exactly do you have in mind?

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:44.640
Oh, come on, there's all
kinds of stuff we could do.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.980
Right, Laila?

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:49.980
Urgh! You always push
things on to me like that

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:53.350
whenever you don't want
to think for yourself!

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:55.490
--Yup!
--Don't act big!

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:59.360
But we definitely can't
keep going on like this...

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:04.260
Yeah! Let's cheer Hosei up!

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:07.700
So, do you have any
good suggestions, Ryuko?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:11.440
Wait, you're pushing it
on to me, Lady Laila?

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.740
I can't come up with
a good idea that quickly...

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:16.940
Man! You're no help at all!

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.710
You're in no place to talk!

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:22.680
I-I know. Hosei is simpleminded.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.780
I'm sure some encouragement from <i>you</i>
would cheer him up a little, Lady Laila.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:28.550
I've been trying to this whole time...

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:35.420
Thanks, Laila! But it's okay!
I'm perfectly fine!

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:41.230
I'm not sure I had any effect at all...

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:42.870
I see.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.700
A situation like this calls for food!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.270
Huh? Food?

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:49.780
A full stomach will cheer him up!

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:52.280
Which means meat! Meat!

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:54.210
Yes! Okay!

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:56.880
Wait, Taito! Where are you going?!

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.490
Meat! I'm getting some meat!

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:05.490
Sheesh, you always just do
whatever you want, Taito!

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:07.830
Or should I say you're stupid?

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:13.430
A full stomach cheering someone up...
Only a kid would think that up.

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:14.730
Right, Ryuko?!

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.270
Yes. There <i>is</i> logic to what Taito says.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:19.670
Not you too?!

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:21.140
Lady Laila.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:25.240
What do you say to making
a home-cooked meal for Hosei's sake?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.310
You want <i>me</i> to cook?

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:33.080
Nothing makes a man happier
than a meal prepared by the girl he loves.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:37.090
Oh? Somehow it sounds like
you say that out of experience...

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:41.530
Does that mean you have
a girl you love too?

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:43.430
No, umm, uhh...

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:46.470
Oh! You do!

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:49.970
Hey! What's she like?! Tell me!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.370
I-I'm not sure how to answer...

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:57.980
Oh! Quit being embarrassed
and just come out with it, lover-boy!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:01.350
Sh-she also lives at the Tong You Temple.

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.780
Oh? So, is she pretty?

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:07.190
Yes. She's a very intelligent woman.

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:12.680
For an inexperienced person like me,
she is a lofty, unattainable dream!

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.790
I did it again...

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:24.340
It's another bustling day for the soup line...

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.740
It's hard to feel joy about it, though...

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.650
Excuse me. You look like you're
a member of the Tong You Temple...

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.190
That's right.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:45.020
Could I possibly help?

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.560
Help?

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:51.160
No offense, but why would a wealthy
girl like you want to do that?

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.860
It's because...

00:05:56.840 --> 00:06:00.040
Thanks. We appreciate it. Come with me.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.610
Yes...

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:03.280
Umm, Shokaku...

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.780
Please go on.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:07.870
Thank you, Shokaku.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:14.720
You, there. If you're worried,
why don't you help too?

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.370
Basically, what's most important
is to put feeling into it.

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:30.600
It doesn't matter if the cooking
is good or bad in this case.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:35.740
Somehow it sounds more like you don't
expect much from my cooking.

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:38.380
No, that isn't what I meant...

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:43.450
Just so you know, I <i>do</i> have
confidence in my cooking skills!

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:44.720
My father even said,

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:49.490
"You should save your cooking
for your future husband!"

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.120
Oh! It sounds like we can count on you!

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:56.560
In that case, I'll meet up with Taito
and gather some ingredients.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:07:00.470
Have Hosei fish or something
in the meantime!

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:02.000
Okay! Got it!

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.470
All right! I'll be back!

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:07.300
That's the opposite direction Taito's in!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:13.910
Meat! Meat! Meat!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:17.610
Wait, what exactly should I catch for meat?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:25.580
I guess it's not worth thinking
too hard about! I'll just catch whatever!

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.990
Found some already!

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:33.600
Damn! Get back here!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.290
Hey! Give yourself up!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:40.270
You got some real guts!

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:50.480
Don't tell me I'm lost...?

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.530
What's taking so long?
What's taking so long?

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:02.360
What's taking so long?!

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.200
What the heck are those two doing?!

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.200
Honestly, now!

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:10.540
How am I supposed to make food
if the ingredients won't show up?!

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:15.370
I can't wait anymore!
I'll just have to do it myself!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:21.970
Rabbits are no good.
They're too little to fill him up.

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.050
Birds...

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:30.040
Poultry! All right!

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:35.580
Where exactly... am I?!

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:45.400
Wow! Here's another!

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:49.170
Sheesh! We should've
done this from the start!

00:08:55.410 --> 00:09:01.420
Oh, wow! Are these
Shenzhen Mushrooms?

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:06.290
Eating one supposedly
cures any illness instantly!

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:08.430
Are these Kankin Mushrooms?!

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:11.730
You hardly ever see any of these!

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.630
Oh, it's a mountain of treasure!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:18.630
This should be enough
to make Hosei feel better!

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:24.880
No birds. Birds fly and stuff.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:28.650
Besides, bird meat is so dry
it doesn't feel like you ate anything.

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:32.650
Men need something
that really fills the belly.

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:33.950
What's that?

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:41.560
Nah, I dunno...

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:48.000
Hmm. They're kinda little, but I bet
they'd make a good side dish.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.630
Okay! I'll snatch those little buggers up!

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.970
G-get back here!

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.440
N-not again...

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:09.990
A dead-end...

00:10:09.990 --> 00:10:10.860
All right.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:16.190
The correct thing to do at a time like this
is follow the path you took back.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.830
Which one is it?

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:36.820
Okay, Hosei. Pay close attention.
Fishing is just like martial arts.

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:40.020
You pull the rod up while matching
your opponent's breathing and timing.

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:42.650
Do that and... Gotcha!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.520
See?

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.390
Master...

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:51.550
Hosei.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:59.060
I, umm, tried making some
food for you. Will you have some?

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:03.410
Really?! That's great!

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:04.910
Okay! Here you go!

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:07.880
Despite how I seem,
cooking is my specialty!

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:12.080
Plus I know all about mushrooms
and medicinal herbs and stuff!

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.200
Okay! This way!

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.370
Meat! Meat! Meat! Meat!

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:47.750
What is it this time?!

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:50.190
I don't care, just as long as it's meat!

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:56.250
Take this!

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:02.460
Huh?

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:10.780
C'mon. I'm sorry about that, Ryuko.
Will you just let it go now?

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:13.950
I just figured you were
a bear or something...

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:17.220
Still, the fact you couldn't
dodge such a simple attack

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:20.420
also goes to show that you lack
training or that you're stupid...

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:24.590
I didn't dodge it because
I knew it was you!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:30.430
I never imagined that you would
suddenly attack a comrade!

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:34.830
Besides, you always run off without
considering the consequences!

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:39.400
I went through so much trouble
looking for you all over the place...

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:43.170
Wait, did you get lost?

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:46.340
N-no! I was not lost at all!

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:52.520
Oh! You got lost and lonely!
You should've just said so--!

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:57.260
Say any more and I won't
remain my mild self!

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.760
'K-kay...

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:03.800
Anyway, we need to gather ingredients
and hurry back to Lady Laila.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.990
Yeah, true.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:11.300
Hosei!

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:15.840
I kind of messed up last time,
but it's okay this time!

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:20.480
It was a little bitter last time,
so I tried adding things to spice it up!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:23.310
Okay! Eat up!

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:37.800
Ryuko. Did you hear something just now?

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:39.700
No.

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:43.330
Anyway, let's hurry.
The sun is about to set.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:46.400
Finding prey in the darkness
will prove difficult.

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:52.340
Dammit! I should've just caught
those things, even though they were small!

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.480
Drop the act. I'm sure
you just let them get away.

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:58.820
Wh-what?! You be quiet!
You weren't even there to see me!

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:00.350
Even so, I can tell.

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:05.990
Knowing you, you ran at them
head-on and let them escape easily.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:10.090
Wild animals are surprisingly smart, after all.

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:13.770
And where did you
end up at after getting lost?

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:17.370
Quit harping on the past.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:22.740
We'll need to be careful whenever
we ask you to lead the way from now on!

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.280
Perhaps <i>you</i> should gain enough intelligence

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:27.950
to keep wild animals
from making a fool of you.

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:29.670
What did you say?!

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.190
There's some meat!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:44.630
Wait, Taito! I don't think
you should go up there!

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:48.460
Hah! If you're too afraid,
then just wait here!

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.310
What?!

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:03.470
What's wrong, Taito? If you don't
hurry up, the prey will be all mine!

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:05.940
Why, you...!

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:09.720
I won't lose!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:15.590
Looks like I win!

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:18.650
No, I was one instant quicker.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:31.240
Hosei...

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.730
My master... My master is calling...

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.450
Hosei!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.350
I got it just right this time!

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:43.750
It was too bitter the first time
and too spicy the second time, right?

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:47.790
So this time I took the middle
route and made it sweet!

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:50.690
Okay! Eat lots and lots!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:01.510
This prey is mine! So go
wander around all happy-like!

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:03.510
That's my line!

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:06.500
<i>You</i> should go play with
mountain monkeys or something!

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:10.650
So you insist on getting in my way?!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.280
No, I can't count on you to do this job!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:17.550
Not good enough!

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:21.950
"Take advantage of every
opportunity," huh?!

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:27.550
It looks like you've improved a little.

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:30.330
What's that?!

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:31.630
What?! What?!

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:34.570
Oww...

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:36.140
That's not fair, Ryuko!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:39.010
You have a bad habit
of quickly lowering your guard.

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.240
Why, you...!

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:43.580
You sure know how to get me mad!
You sure know how to get me mad!

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:45.050
What about you?!

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:49.650
You kept saying that I'm stupid
and that I have no sense of direction!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:53.090
I did call you stupid, but I said
nothing about your sense of direction!

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:54.320
Silence!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.770
This time! This time it will be good for sure!

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:25.180
There! Perfect! This will make
Hosei feel 100% better in one shot!

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:31.800
You have the strength of a brute!

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:33.700
What are you, a monkey?!

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:37.300
Is fleeing all you can do, Taito?!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:41.030
All right! I'll come at you
if that's what you want!

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:53.550
That idiot! He's using inner-channeling?!

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.040
Eat this, Ryuko!

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:21.250
Honestly, you two! What in
the world were you thinking?!

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:24.180
Explain why you wound up fighting
all buddy-buddy-like until the sun set

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.080
instead of going to collect
ingredients like you said!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.790
--W-we weren't fighting.
We were working together--
--No excuses!

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:31.590
Right...

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:36.130
Urgh! I guess I was the only
one busting my butt today!

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.500
Incidentally, Lady Laila...
Where is Hosei?

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:43.800
He said he wanted to be alone for a while...

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:49.940
Laila. Don't tell me you
did something bad to Hosei...?

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.880
What are you talking about?!
I didn't do anything bad!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:57.980
All I did was cook some food
to help cheer up Hosei--

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:01.520
Whoa! You had Hosei eat your cooking?!

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:05.220
Hold on, Taito!
What do you mean by that?!

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:10.860
Even Hosei would want to run away
after eating your cooking...

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:12.630
It's that bad?

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:18.200
It's worse than bad! One time
she almost killed me and our dad!

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.400
That's horrifying...

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.170
You two!

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:25.140
Laila... It's okay now.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.340
Hosei...

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:35.820
What's this?

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:37.560
I caught it.

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:40.520
You're hungry, right?
Let's all eat it.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:41.860
Hosei...

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:45.090
And... thanks.

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:48.560
I'm all better now.

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:57.110
Man... I guess you <i>can</i> be
thoughtful sometimes, Hosei.

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:59.910
What do you mean "sometimes"?!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:04.280
Oh! You already have a stew ready!

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:07.180
I'm quite hungry, too!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.780
Wait! That's...!

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:25.230
<i>Our journey leads us to</i>
<i>Luo Chang, our final destination</i>.

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:28.370
<i>Is Keiro that strong?</i>

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:32.140
<i>If you have a just cause,</i>
<i>the heavens will show you a way</i>.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:35.940
<i>I came to have a chat with you, boy</i>.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:39.410
<i>The imperial capital has light</i>
<i>and darkness. This is its true face</i>.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.910
<i>What is the emperor doing?!</i>

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:45.920
<i>The gears of karma grind and accelerate</i>.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:50.580
<i>On Hero Tales, "Chapter Nine:</i>
<i>Shadow on the Imperial Capital."</i>

00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:05.630
<i>The heavens have approved!</i>
<i>Become the emperor!</i>
